<title>LATVIA: SAULES SECURITIES LICENCE EXTENDED.</title>
<headline>SAULES SECURITIES LICENCE EXTENDED.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The securities commission on Wednesday said it has extended the securities licence of Saules Bank to June 11 1998.</p>
<p>The markets watchdog also said in a statement that it gave a licence to the eMSi-trast company to operator as a securities dealer.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
